Jackson, MS Tue Jun 10, 2014 USDA - MS Dept of Ag Market News
Hattiesburg, MS - Southeast Livestock Exchange
Feeder and Slaughter Cattle Report for Mon Jun 09, 2014
Receipts This week 1,310 Last Week 1,032
Compared to last week slaughter cows trended 2.00 to 4.00 Higher. Slaughter
bulls trended 1.00 to 2.00 Higher. Feeder steers trended 5.00 to 10.00 Higher.
Feeder heifers trended 5.00 to 12.00 Higher. Feeder consisted of 54 percent
steers and 46 percent heifers. Receipts weighing under 600 lbs 67 percent
over 600 lbs 13 percent. Total receipts were made up of 80 percent feeders,
9 percent slaughter cows and 11 percent Pairs/Replacements.
